; The patrol car, the cop's vehicle (P1-021): it starts as the car tune (car.tres, P1-020) with a white stand-in body.
; GAME.md "Movement and camera feel": about 140 km/h, 0 to 100 km/h in 10 to 12 s, 100 to 0 in 38 to 45 m. Keep the
